  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6201.01 “Actual expenses incurred” means the amount calculated using the process provided in Saf-C 6202 for each of the courses or programs conducted by the division as training or services offered by the division.\n\nSource. #7552, INTERIM, eff 9-5-01, EXPIRED: 3-4-02\n\nNew. #7747, eff 8-17-02; ss by #9496, eff 6-26-09; ss by #12477, eff 2-8-18",
